# Cloudflare Pages redirects — https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Preserve inbound links to the old WordPress site (ecrs.org) after the
# production cutover. Paths gathered from the live WordPress nav/footer as of
# 2026-07-08. Gallery, public resources, testimonials, and the mailing-list
# signup have no equivalent page on the new site, so they redirect to the
# closest relevant page rather than 404ing.

/about-us-2/*              /about   301
/about-us/*                /about   301
/history-of-ecrs/*         /about   301
/what-makes-ecrs-special/* /about   301
/our-leadership/*          /our-people   301
/upcoming-events/*         /events   301
/contact-us/*              /contact   301
/photo-gallery/*           /about   301
/public-resources/*        /about   301
/testimonials/*            /about   301
/join-our-mailing-list/*   /contact   301
